<p>You surge with a life draining energy for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4, 4, 5, 5, 6</acronym> turns.</p><p>While the effect lasts, you heal yourself for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">6%, 8%, 9%, 10%, 10%</acronym> of all damage you deal.</p>